Throughout Operation Iraqi Freedom, the A-10 Warthog was the most well-known and feared plane in the U.S.

7
00:00:40,684 --> 00:00:41,700
Air Force.

8
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:47,960
I think it was the best equipped Air Force and Army rated fight that we could have.

9
00:00:47,961 --> 00:00:52,380
its ability to work in close support with ground troops,

10
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,520
to take out enemy positions and tanks,

11
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:01,580
