When they need help, they call, and that's who they expect to be there.

14
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:17,940
But for the vision of a handful of men, this aircraft was almost never built.

15
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:28,100
in World War One aircraft were used as a way of supporting the troops on the ground

16
00:01:28,101 --> 00:01:33,980
in facing down resistance the planes were called in to either bomb or wipe out the enemy

17
00:01:33,981 --> 00:01:45,200
close support in cases of mobile warfare of moving fronts of fast moving combat whether

18
00:01:45,201 --> 00:01:49,573
