25
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:20,240
But one single aircraft was feared as the ultimate close air support machine.

26
00:02:20,241 --> 00:02:25,760
The German Uckes 87 dive bomber nicknamed the Stuka and fitted with a screaming siren.

27
00:02:25,761 --> 00:02:32,760
