34
00:03:13,341 --> 00:03:23,920
But with the defeat of Germany in 1945, the success of close air support was largely overlooked.

35
00:03:23,921 --> 00:03:29,280
On September 18, 1947, the United States Air Force was born.

36
00:03:29,281 --> 00:03:34,900
Its main focus, to deliver nuclear weapons.

37
