This is the extraordinary part of the whole genesis of the A-10.

39
00:03:42,721 --> 00:03:47,660
The Air Force, traditionally, from the beginnings of World War II on, had no interest in close

40
00:03:47,661 --> 00:03:49,160
support, have none today.

41
00:03:49,161 --> 00:03:53,860
They don't like working for the Army, they prefer running their own war, totally independent

