00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:17,860
We had secretly assembled what we proudly boasted at the time was like the third or fourth largest tank army in the world.

110
00:10:17,861 --> 00:10:22,460
on over 300 Soviet tanks from all over the world,

111
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,920
off junk heaps and whatever,

112
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:26,220
out in the desert outside Las Vegas.

113
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:32,520
So we ran a program with A-10s, with a gun installed,

