115
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:43,400
She had a very strange sound to those engines,

116
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,400
very characteristic, and to this day,

117
00:10:46,401 --> 00:10:51,200
every time I hear it, I look up because I know it's my bird.

