00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:40,780
During the Cold War, the threat of Soviet tanks advancing on Western Europe was at times a very real possibility.

125
00:11:40,781 --> 00:11:49,960
the Air Force finally gives the production of the A-10 the go-ahead it was now ready to face a specific enemy

