170
00:14:51,581 --> 00:14:54,580
But it's the challenge of the unique close air support role

171
00:14:54,581 --> 00:14:57,580
that's the main attraction to the A-10 pilots.

172
00:14:57,581 --> 00:15:02,580
It's an environment where anything can happen at any time.

173
00:15:02,581 --> 00:15:06,320
The mission that we do is not a rote mission.

174
00:15:06,740 --> 00:15:09,740
You don't come into it knowing exactly every single thing that's going to happen

175
00:15:09,741 --> 00:15:11,380
