176
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,280
Once you get in the air is where it starts actually unfolding,

177
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:16,940
and you have to react to that.

178
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:22,900
You hear American voices on the radio screaming

179
00:15:22,901 --> 00:15:25,760
